  "details": "Description\n\nAfter a weird bug I had with the game I attempted to play again only to be met with the only location I could go to was the default home. Any world I tried to go wouldn’t even download, can’t preload either I just instantly returned to the default home. Persists on multiple devices reinstalling the game does not fix the issue.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nStart the game, attempt to join any world, it faills, returned to defualt VRChat Home world. That is about as much as I can say it is mostly detailed above.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: iOSMobile (platform: iOS - Mobile, store: TestFlight, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: IPhonePlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.30200\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-14_22-52-00.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_fbcb2185-bbc1-49cd-a69a-0b954cc41050/1/file)",
